---
import Words from '../ui/Words.astro';
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
import CheckoutButton from '../ui/CheckoutButton.astro';
import { PRICING } from '@/config/site';

const { yearly } = PRICING.plans;
---

<section id="roi" class="relative py-20 sm:py-28" data-track-view="roi">
  <div class="container-x">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr] lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal><span class="n">10</span> The math</p>
        <Words text="The math is *almost embarrassing.*" class="h-section mt-6" />
        <p class="lead mt-6 max-w-[520px]" data-reveal style="--d:200">
          A full-time assistant in the US costs a median <span class="text-text">$76,590 a year</span>. Godmode Pro costs
          <span class="text-text">${yearly.price} a year</span> — less than that assistant earns in two days — and it works
          nights, weekends and holidays.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3" data-reveal style="--d:300">
          <div class="card p-5">
            <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-dim uppercase">Assistant / year</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[32px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]" data-count="76590" data-prefix="$">$76,590</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[12px] text-dim">US median, BLS</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5 ring-1 ring-[rgb(47_214_144/0.3)]">
            <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-brand uppercase">Godmode / year</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[32px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]" data-count={yearly.price} data-prefix="$">${yearly.price}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[12px] text-dim">Pro yearly + your Claude plan</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-[520px] text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted" data-reveal style="--d:350">
          And the gap grows every week: an agent’s memory and routines compound. The team that starts now has months of
          learned workflows by the time everyone else begins.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-7 sm:p-10" data-roi data-roi-cost={yearly.price} data-reveal="scale" style="--d:150">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <p class="text-[17px] font-medium tracking-tight">What is your busywork worth?</p>
          <span class="chip"><Icon name="calculator" size={11} /> calculator</span>
        </div>

        <label class="mt-8 block">
          <span class="flex items-baseline justify-between text-[14px] text-text-2">
            Hours of repetitive computer work per week
            <b class="font-mono text-[15px] font-medium text-text" data-out="hours">15</b>
          </span>
          <input class="range mt-2" type="range" name="hours" min="1" max="60" value="15" />
        </label>
        <label class="mt-6 block">
          <span class="flex items-baseline justify-between text-[14px] text-text-2">
            What an hour of your (or your team’s) time is worth
            <b class="font-mono text-[15px] font-medium text-text" data-out="rate">$100</b>
          </span>
          <input class="range mt-2" type="range" name="rate" min="20" max="500" step="10" value="100" />
        </label>

        <div class="rule my-8"></div>

        <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <dt class="text-[13px] text-muted">Hours back per year</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-[34px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em]" data-out="saved-hours">504</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-[13px] text-muted">Worth per year</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-[34px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] text-brand" data-out="saved">$50,400</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-[13px] text-muted">A year of Godmode pays off in</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-[22px] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em]" data-out="payback">4 days</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-[13px] text-muted">Every week you wait costs</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-[22px] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#f0a488]" data-out="weekly-loss">$1,050</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <CheckoutButton plan="monthly" label={`Try it free for ${PRICING.trialDays} days`} source="roi" full size="lg" class="mt-9" />
        <p class="mt-3 text-center text-[12px] text-dim">
          Estimate assumes Godmode takes over 70% of those hours across 48 working weeks. Your results depend on your tasks.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
